<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Cerj 1996 net loss 267.4 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil Cerj 1996 net loss 267.4 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rio de Janeiro state electricity distributor Cerj has posted the following 1996 results. These are the first annual results to be published since the company was privatized in November.</p>
<p>				    1996		1995</p>
<p>    Net loss		   267.4 million	  62.8 million</p>
<p>    Net revenue		464.9 million	 362.6 million</p>
<p>Note: all figures in Brazilian reais and according to Brazilian Generally Accepted Accounting Principles.</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
